OL,3,GNEWSATeenager who lost mum says she no
OL,4,Alonger feels alone in her grief
OL,5,
OL,6,FUntil recently 17-year-old Niamh says
OL,7,Fshe would often feel alone while
OL,8,Fdealing with the loss of her mother who
OL,9,Fdied a few years ago.
OL,11,FBut now she says creating art and
OL,12,Ftalking to other young people has
OL,13,Fhelped her process that grief.
OL,15,FShe is one of about 100 teenagers who
OL,16,Fhave taken part in a project to help
OL,17,Fthem deal with bereavement and loss.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
